OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1791541107
OL,3,CGuernsey player secures first
OL,4,Cinternational cap in England debut
OL,6,FGuernsey-born Alex Scott got his first
OL,7,FEngland cap last night after playing
OL,8,FCzechia in the Nations League on
OL,9,FTuesday 29 September.
OL,11,FThe Three Lions were already up 2-0
OL,12,Fafter a Gordon header two minutes into
OL,13,Fthe second half, with England captain
OL,14,FKane cementing their lead in the 69th
OL,15,Fminute.
OL,17,FA minute later, the AFC Bournemouth
OL,18,Fplayer came in as a second-half
OL,19,Fsubstitution, replacing Elliott
OL,20,FAnderson.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/3
