PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1791541107
OL,3,CGuernsey player secures first
OL,4,Cinternational cap in England debut
OL,6,FIt makes Scott the first male Channel
OL,7,FIslander to play at a national level
OL,8,Fsince Matt Le Tissier.
OL,10,FSpeaking to ITV Sport, Scott said he
OL,11,Fwas "grateful for the opportunity",
OL,12,Fand that watching England play from
OL,13,Fthe sidelines was "all part" of his
OL,14,Fdevelopment as a player.
OL,16,F"I've learned a lot, definitely. I
OL,17,Fthink my first camp, last November, I
OL,18,Fprobably wasn't ready to play," Scott
OL,19,Fexplained.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/3
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1791541107
OL,3,CGuernsey player secures first
OL,4,Cinternational cap in England debut
OL,6,F"I'm obviously really happy. It's
OL,7,Fsomething that you dream of as a kid,
OL,8,Fand when you're young, you don't ever
OL,9,Freally think it's going to be a
OL,10,Freality, so a lot of hard work's gone
OL,11,Finto that.
OL,13,F"I felt it was a massive step for me,
OL,14,Fbut I've learned a lot on the pitch,
OL,15,Foff the pitch, in training, and I felt
OL,16,Fmore ready in the summer.
OL,18,F"I'm definitely ready now. It's been
OL,19,Fhard work, and I'm really grateful to
OL,20,Fthe staff and the coach for putting me
OL,21,Fin."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/3
